<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ PPI inputs rise 0.1 pct in March qtr and year.</title>
<headline>NZ PPI inputs rise 0.1 pct in March qtr and year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data on the Producers Price Index for the March 1997 quarter (percentage change):</p>
<p>		  Mar 1997 qtr    Dec 1996 qtr    Mar 1996 qtr</p>
<p>Inputs index    +0.1		 +0.1		+0.4</p>
<p>Outputs index   +0.2		 +0.2		+0.2</p>
<p>		Yr-end Mar 1997  Yr-end Dec 1996  Yr-end Mar 1996</p>
<p>Inputs index    +0.1		 +0.4		+0.9</p>
<p>Outputs index   +0.6		 +0.6		+0.9</p>
<p>The PPI measures the average level of industrial input prices (excluding labour) and output prices.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746 REUTER</p>
</text>
